WEBVTT

00:00:12.320 --> 00:00:16.490
That's the apprentice who failed the level 9 exam.

00:00:17.620 --> 00:00:19.990
Just let it go already!

00:01:51.750 --> 00:01:52.710
Welcome.

00:01:52.710 --> 00:01:55.190
What are these? Magic goods, you say?

00:01:55.190 --> 00:01:57.550
What? Are they like charms?

00:01:57.550 --> 00:01:59.010
Right, right.

00:01:59.010 --> 00:02:00.750
How 'bout a love charm?

00:02:00.750 --> 00:02:03.180
Like this pretty magic item here...

00:02:03.180 --> 00:02:05.050
I wonder if they really work.

00:02:05.050 --> 00:02:06.840
It's cute anyway. Why don't we buy it?

00:02:06.840 --> 00:02:08.650
Right, we could make it our mascot.

00:02:08.650 --> 00:02:10.860
Thank you very much.

00:02:15.060 --> 00:02:17.890
I failed the level 9 exam.

00:02:18.440 --> 00:02:20.490
Is this the end for me?

00:02:26.360 --> 00:02:28.440
Go to the Witch World!!

00:02:32.130 --> 00:02:34.490
Why am I the only one who failed?

00:02:35.340 --> 00:02:38.880
I'm supposed to be the most senior apprentice.

00:02:38.880 --> 00:02:41.220
How could those two surpass me?

00:02:41.760 --> 00:02:44.850
I really am the world's unluckiest pretty girl.

00:02:44.850 --> 00:02:51.650
At this rate, I'm gonna be a Witch Frog my whole life.

00:02:57.990 --> 00:02:59.240
That voice...

00:03:00.060 --> 00:03:00.740
Dela?

00:03:04.680 --> 00:03:07.120
~ It's been a long time! ~

00:03:07.120 --> 00:03:09.290
What? What do you want?

00:03:09.290 --> 00:03:18.130
~ I'm here to collect the money for the cash register and the magic spheres! ~

00:03:18.130 --> 00:03:22.220
Oh that. I don't have any money at the moment.

00:03:22.220 --> 00:03:24.260
That could be a problem.

00:03:24.260 --> 00:03:29.770
Ahhh! That song is still ringing in my head. It's giving me a headache.

00:03:29.770 --> 00:03:32.250
What's with that attitude?

00:03:32.250 --> 00:03:35.190
This apprentice failed the level 9 exam, that's why.

00:03:35.190 --> 00:03:39.740
Eh? She failed the level 9 exam? How is that possible?

00:03:39.740 --> 00:03:40.700
How about the other two?

00:03:40.700 --> 00:03:42.740
No way. Just this one.

00:03:43.250 --> 00:03:44.240
What? Is it really that bad!?

00:03:45.800 --> 00:03:46.630
Well...

00:03:46.630 --> 00:03:49.160
What? Is there a reason behind that attitude of yours?

00:03:50.010 --> 00:03:53.230
Actually... I have some interesting info.

00:03:53.230 --> 00:03:55.900
Interesting info? What kind of info?

00:03:55.900 --> 00:03:57.050
How much can you pay?

00:03:57.050 --> 00:04:00.380
How do I know? I don't even know what it is.

00:04:01.760 --> 00:04:03.010
Well...

00:04:03.010 --> 00:04:08.470
What if I say I know a way for that apprentice to catch up with the others?

00:04:08.470 --> 00:04:09.220
What!?

00:04:09.220 --> 00:04:11.350
What? What do you mean?

00:04:11.350 --> 00:04:14.060
What's the info then? Tell us!

00:04:14.060 --> 00:04:15.770
So you're gonna pay for it?

00:04:18.500 --> 00:04:19.730
I have no choice.

00:04:21.320 --> 00:04:27.730
Well, the magic spheres, the cash register, and now the information adds up to...

00:04:27.730 --> 00:04:29.170
How about this?

00:04:29.170 --> 00:04:30.250
T-That's so expensive!

00:04:31.190 --> 00:04:31.700
A make-up exam?

00:04:31.700 --> 00:04:33.780
There's a make-up level 9 exam?

00:04:34.360 --> 00:04:39.500
Well, the examiner Motamota is turning 999 years old soon.

00:04:39.500 --> 00:04:44.630
So the make-up exam for the failed witches is like a commemoration.

00:04:44.950 --> 00:04:46.150
Great!

00:04:46.150 --> 00:04:49.930
I'll catch up with them if I pass the exam.

00:04:49.930 --> 00:04:50.560
Another exam?

00:04:51.180 --> 00:04:55.170
What? Why are you so gloomy? Aren't you happy?

00:04:55.170 --> 00:04:58.820
Are you really confident you'll pass the exam?

00:05:00.070 --> 00:05:01.810
Of... Of course I'll pass.

00:05:02.450 --> 00:05:03.320
I will!

00:05:06.020 --> 00:05:08.370
Fine, then practice.

00:05:08.370 --> 00:05:11.380
Practice? Without any magic spheres?

00:05:11.380 --> 00:05:13.120
Magic spheres...?

00:05:13.120 --> 00:05:16.750
How many? I brought a lot of them with me.

00:05:16.750 --> 00:05:17.740
Here you go.

00:05:18.380 --> 00:05:20.510
~ Thanks a lot! ~

00:05:23.140 --> 00:05:24.470
Now I have to pay extra.

00:05:24.470 --> 00:05:26.760
Well, can't help that.

00:05:26.760 --> 00:05:29.820
If we sell lots and lots of magic goods, then it'll be fine.

00:05:31.340 --> 00:05:32.250
Another exam?

00:05:33.070 --> 00:05:34.980
Can Doremi do it?

00:05:38.720 --> 00:05:39.560
A make-up exam?

00:05:39.560 --> 00:05:40.820
That's great.

00:05:40.820 --> 00:05:43.690
Ya just gotta practice 'til the exam.

00:05:43.690 --> 00:05:45.500
We're gonna help ya.

00:05:45.500 --> 00:05:47.860
Right, if you do your best, there's nothing to it.

00:05:48.390 --> 00:05:51.200
Thank you. I'll do my best.

00:05:52.530 --> 00:05:54.100
Rere will cheer too.

00:05:55.750 --> 00:05:57.040
Mimi'll cheer too.

00:05:58.330 --> 00:06:02.500
I envy you two. I want a cute fairy like yours too.

00:06:02.500 --> 00:06:05.070
Yer gettin' one after passin' the exam.

00:06:05.070 --> 00:06:08.180
Right, Doremi-chan's fairy will surely be cute.

00:06:08.180 --> 00:06:09.350
You think so?

00:06:09.880 --> 00:06:11.010
That'd be wonderful.

00:06:25.280 --> 00:06:27.320
Pretty Witchy Doremi-chi!

00:06:36.500 --> 00:06:39.450
Okay, for practice, how about some tsukimi udon.

00:06:39.460 --> 00:06:41.670
Alright, just leave it to me.

00:06:43.280 --> 00:06:46.630
Pirika Pirilala Poporina Peperuto!

00:06:46.630 --> 00:06:49.560
Tsukimi udon, appear!

00:06:53.320 --> 00:06:55.100
Well, ya got part of it right...

00:06:55.100 --> 00:06:57.220
Did I do something wrong?

00:06:57.880 --> 00:07:00.140
Well, how 'bout chikara (strength) udon?

00:07:00.600 --> 00:07:01.150
'Kay.

00:07:01.950 --> 00:07:04.510
Pirika Pirilala Poporina Peperuto!

00:07:04.510 --> 00:07:05.820
Chikara udon, appear!

00:07:11.010 --> 00:07:13.990
Where's the udon? Can'tcha make the udon part right?

00:07:13.990 --> 00:07:17.700
Udon? Making plain udon is easy!

00:07:18.450 --> 00:07:20.930
Pirika Pirilala Poporina Peperuto!

00:07:20.930 --> 00:07:22.000
Udon, appear!

00:07:25.880 --> 00:07:27.640
Futon? Udon... futon...?

00:07:28.200 --> 00:07:31.610
Doremi-chan, ya should go to Osaka and do a talk show.

00:07:31.610 --> 00:07:32.800
You'd be a hit.

00:07:34.470 --> 00:07:37.100
L-Let's call it for a day.

00:07:37.100 --> 00:07:38.710
Might as well.

00:07:38.710 --> 00:07:41.100
But can you pass the make-up exam?

00:07:41.100 --> 00:07:43.400
I'll do my best for real at the exam.

00:07:43.400 --> 00:07:45.380
I'll pass the exam for sure.

00:07:45.380 --> 00:07:46.730
Right.

00:07:49.030 --> 00:07:50.570
Can you really pass?

00:07:59.040 --> 00:08:01.210
Harukaze

00:08:01.210 --> 00:08:03.230
Today's the make-up exam.

00:08:08.850 --> 00:08:10.970
Don't pee in the bed.

00:08:16.890 --> 00:08:21.100
She was sleepwalking. Scared me there.

00:08:28.110 --> 00:08:30.960
Will Doremi-chan be alright alone?

00:08:40.290 --> 00:08:42.770
Can Doremi-chan pass the exam?

00:08:42.770 --> 00:08:45.440
She didn't do so hot today while practicin'.

00:08:47.290 --> 00:08:50.380
I'm really worried. I can't sleep at all.

00:08:52.520 --> 00:08:53.460
What are ya doin', Mimi?

00:08:58.260 --> 00:08:59.220
Mimi.

00:09:07.590 --> 00:09:08.300
You mean...

00:09:08.850 --> 00:09:11.530
You want to stay home in my place?

00:09:17.410 --> 00:09:18.290
Ai-chan!

00:09:20.400 --> 00:09:21.400
Hadzuki-chan.

00:09:21.400 --> 00:09:24.150
Are you here because you're worried about Doremi-chan?

00:09:24.150 --> 00:09:26.580
Yeah, I'm worried about Majo Rika goin' with her alone.

00:09:27.630 --> 00:09:29.160
Well?

00:09:29.160 --> 00:09:33.000
She's goin' to the Witch World with Majo Rika and Lala.

00:09:33.000 --> 00:09:37.340
I'm worried about Doremi-chan. Let's try and follow them.

00:09:37.340 --> 00:09:38.050
Yeah.

00:09:40.030 --> 00:09:41.370
Alright, let's go.

00:09:41.370 --> 00:09:42.220
Yeah...

00:09:50.940 --> 00:09:52.210
The gate is open.

00:09:52.210 --> 00:09:52.850
Let's go.

00:09:54.440 --> 00:09:55.640
Good luck.

00:09:55.640 --> 00:09:56.900
Y-Yeah.

00:09:57.460 --> 00:09:59.200
Well, can you pass?

00:09:59.200 --> 00:10:01.660
Hm, I guess.

00:10:02.990 --> 00:10:06.050
Hey Doremi, I'm begging you. Don't fail the exam.

00:10:06.050 --> 00:10:10.920
My life as a witch would be over if you kept on being an apprentice.

00:10:10.920 --> 00:10:16.170
Hey! Don't give me any pressure. Or how am I going to do my best?

00:10:16.170 --> 00:10:18.970
Your best? What's your best?

00:10:18.970 --> 00:10:22.680
You're only an annoying little Ojamajo who can't make magics goods or ride the broom.

00:10:22.680 --> 00:10:23.810
Shut up!

00:10:23.810 --> 00:10:26.020
Alright, you two, stop fighting.

00:10:26.020 --> 00:10:31.190
Doremi is obviously nervous before taking the exam, so stop talking to her so much, Majo Rika.

00:10:31.190 --> 00:10:34.090
Yeah, she's right, say something nice for a change.

00:10:34.090 --> 00:10:35.980
I'm only telling the truth.

00:10:35.980 --> 00:10:37.000
What?

00:10:40.660 --> 00:10:41.570
Huh?

00:10:41.570 --> 00:10:42.640
What is it?

00:10:42.640 --> 00:10:45.020
The testing booth isn't here.

00:10:45.020 --> 00:10:45.640
What!?

00:10:47.960 --> 00:10:49.250
You're right.

00:10:49.250 --> 00:10:52.040
Did Dela make it up to swindle us?

00:11:14.090 --> 00:11:17.120
Mota and Motamota live somewhere near here.

00:11:17.120 --> 00:11:18.070
Let's check it out.

00:11:18.910 --> 00:11:19.650
There it is.

00:11:19.650 --> 00:11:22.450
That Dela, I'll get her if she tricked me.

00:11:23.630 --> 00:11:25.900
Cooooomiiiiiiing......

00:11:27.260 --> 00:11:29.350
I've got a bad feeling about this all of a sudden.

00:11:30.850 --> 00:11:32.920
Welcome.....

00:11:32.920 --> 00:11:34.630
Is there a make-up exam?

00:11:34.630 --> 00:11:40.090
Hm, we wanted to commemorate by having a make-up exam.

00:11:40.090 --> 00:11:43.220
But Motamota's in bed having a cold.

00:11:43.220 --> 00:11:46.160
Come check back about 100 years from now...

00:11:47.400 --> 00:11:48.820
100 years from now?

00:11:48.820 --> 00:11:50.560
Are you kidding!? I can't wait for that long!

00:11:50.560 --> 00:11:53.350
But she's got a cold.....

00:11:53.350 --> 00:11:54.570
I know!

00:11:54.570 --> 00:11:59.690
How about finding the herbs to cure her cold as the exam?

00:12:00.240 --> 00:12:02.680
Yeah! That would be great.

00:12:02.680 --> 00:12:03.780
Alright!

00:12:03.780 --> 00:12:06.050
You sure that would be okay?

00:12:06.050 --> 00:12:08.520
Ohh, of course...

00:12:09.930 --> 00:12:10.900
Listen, Doremi.

00:12:10.900 --> 00:12:14.930
Go to the Witch's Meadow and get some Sneeze Grass, as this book says.

00:12:14.930 --> 00:12:17.500
We can cure Motamota's cold with that.

00:12:17.500 --> 00:12:18.590
G-Got it.

00:12:18.590 --> 00:12:25.220
Thank goodness the exam is so easy. Well, I'll just wait here and have some tea.

00:12:25.810 --> 00:12:27.510
Alright, count on me.

00:12:28.500 --> 00:12:30.560
She said something about the Witch's Meadow...

00:12:31.560 --> 00:12:34.150
"The best ramen shop in the Witch World!"

00:12:34.150 --> 00:12:36.310
"This cafe has the most delicious cakes."

00:12:36.310 --> 00:12:38.100
No, no!

00:12:38.100 --> 00:12:41.480
Okay... The Witch's Meadow is...

00:12:44.200 --> 00:12:45.030
Oh well...

00:12:45.780 --> 00:12:47.090
Doremi-chan!

00:12:48.530 --> 00:12:50.180
Ai-chan, Hadzuki-chan!

00:12:50.180 --> 00:12:52.410
We came here because we're worried.

00:12:52.410 --> 00:12:53.290
Would you mind?

00:12:53.290 --> 00:12:56.500
Of course not, I'm so happy. Thank you.

00:12:56.500 --> 00:12:58.180
What's the problem?

00:12:58.180 --> 00:13:00.170
It says I have to go to the Witch's Meadow.

00:13:00.170 --> 00:13:02.380
I have to get this kind of grass.

00:13:02.380 --> 00:13:04.340
The Witch's Meadow?

00:13:04.340 --> 00:13:08.350
Let's search together. We'll find it for sure.

00:13:08.350 --> 00:13:09.560
Yep.

00:13:13.520 --> 00:13:16.650
Aren't we getting further away from the Witch's Meadow?

00:13:16.650 --> 00:13:18.920
There's a ramen shop.

00:13:18.920 --> 00:13:21.390
But we don't have the time.

00:13:23.530 --> 00:13:27.070
I can't do my best with an empty stomach.

00:13:27.070 --> 00:13:29.460
I think we'd better eat something first.

00:13:29.460 --> 00:13:30.530
I agree with that!

00:13:31.700 --> 00:13:33.290
Welcome!

00:13:34.400 --> 00:13:36.570
Shouyu ramen costs 3 magic spheres.

00:13:36.570 --> 00:13:38.880
Miso ramen costs 4 magic spheres.

00:13:39.430 --> 00:13:40.710
This ain't good.

00:13:40.710 --> 00:13:43.220
It's a shame to use so many spheres.

00:13:43.220 --> 00:13:45.090
Majo Rika would be mad.

00:13:45.090 --> 00:13:47.350
You. Can I get your autograph?

00:13:47.560 --> 00:13:48.510
Eh? Who?

00:13:48.510 --> 00:13:50.250
You, of course. You.

00:13:50.250 --> 00:13:51.040
Me?

00:13:51.040 --> 00:13:52.310
Yes, you.

00:13:53.470 --> 00:13:54.350
Why?

00:13:54.350 --> 00:13:58.800
Is it because I'm so talented and have become an idol now?

00:13:58.800 --> 00:14:01.000
Didn't you fail the level 9 exam?

00:14:01.650 --> 00:14:05.070
You almost never see such a rare apprentice.

00:14:05.070 --> 00:14:08.910
How do you know that Doremi-chan failed the level 9 exam?

00:14:08.910 --> 00:14:13.040
Dela the wholesaler is talking about it all over the Witch World.

00:14:13.040 --> 00:14:15.540
That woman...

00:14:15.540 --> 00:14:18.270
You'll get free ramen if you give me an autograph.

00:14:18.270 --> 00:14:19.170
How about it?

00:14:22.420 --> 00:14:23.930
Sorry, Doremi-chan.

00:14:23.930 --> 00:14:26.090
But, it's really tasty, isn't it?

00:14:28.790 --> 00:14:32.390
So everyone's talking about me failing the level 9 exam.

00:14:34.060 --> 00:14:34.770
T-That smell...

00:14:34.770 --> 00:14:36.390
It's takoyaki!

00:14:36.390 --> 00:14:39.750
W-Wait! We don't have time for takoyaki!

00:14:39.750 --> 00:14:42.560
Y-Yeah! Remember about Doremi-chan's exam!

00:14:43.860 --> 00:14:45.030
Gimme!

00:14:47.670 --> 00:14:48.950
It's delicious...

00:14:49.690 --> 00:14:51.790
Yep, just like in Osaka.

00:14:52.410 --> 00:14:54.580
But is this really okay?

00:14:58.120 --> 00:15:00.250
Hadzuki-chan, what is it?

00:15:02.190 --> 00:15:03.460
She's so slow!

00:15:03.460 --> 00:15:05.050
What in the world is she doing?

00:15:05.050 --> 00:15:12.760
Don't tell me she's getting ramen, takoyaki, and cakes first like the book said?

00:15:12.760 --> 00:15:14.260
Don't worry so much.

00:15:18.550 --> 00:15:20.530
Why am I here again?

00:15:20.530 --> 00:15:23.020
You're here to take the level 9 make-up exam.

00:15:23.020 --> 00:15:26.350
Yeah! I'd almost forgotten.

00:15:26.350 --> 00:15:29.150
Alright! I'm full. Let's get goin'!

00:15:29.150 --> 00:15:31.110
Where are you going?

00:15:31.110 --> 00:15:33.630
To the Witch's Meadow.

00:15:33.630 --> 00:15:34.090
Eh!?

00:15:34.660 --> 00:15:35.580
Somethin' wrong?

00:15:35.580 --> 00:15:39.330
The Witch's Meadow is on the other side of town.

00:15:39.330 --> 00:15:40.660
Oh no!

00:15:40.660 --> 00:15:43.060
Which direction are we goin' now?

00:15:43.060 --> 00:15:44.730
Whichever gets us there!

00:15:44.730 --> 00:15:49.410
The book says there's a huge tower at the entrance of the Witch's Meadow.

00:15:49.410 --> 00:15:50.170
Can you see it?

00:15:51.240 --> 00:15:52.300
Could it be...

00:15:53.340 --> 00:15:53.900
That one?

00:15:57.560 --> 00:16:00.200
One thing's for sure. It's very far.

00:16:00.200 --> 00:16:00.860
Yeah...

00:16:01.390 --> 00:16:03.470
Just like my chance to pass the exam.

00:16:03.470 --> 00:16:05.730
O-Of course not.

00:16:05.730 --> 00:16:08.110
Let's go to the tower anyway.

00:16:09.300 --> 00:16:11.360
This forest is full of brooms.

00:16:12.670 --> 00:16:16.950
If I take a broom as a lucky charm, maybe I'll be able to ride better.

00:16:16.950 --> 00:16:18.880
You!

00:16:18.880 --> 00:16:19.790
W-Who's that?

00:16:21.620 --> 00:16:26.290
What are you doing? The brooms are very sacred to the witches.

00:16:26.290 --> 00:16:27.750
I-I'm sorry.

00:16:27.750 --> 00:16:30.710
Oh yeah, could you tell us which way to the Witch's Meadow?

00:16:30.710 --> 00:16:36.180
The Witch's Meadow is still very far from here. You have to get through this forest first.

00:16:36.180 --> 00:16:37.650
Thanks!

00:16:37.650 --> 00:16:38.880
Let's go, Doremi-chan.

00:16:39.900 --> 00:16:41.430
Hold it!

00:16:44.690 --> 00:16:48.650
You have to answer my question to get through here.

00:16:48.650 --> 00:16:49.870
What did ya say?

00:16:49.870 --> 00:16:51.410
Okay, it sounds like fun.

00:16:51.410 --> 00:16:52.360
What's the question?

00:16:52.360 --> 00:16:54.900
Alright! If you're ready, here it is.

00:16:54.900 --> 00:16:59.740
Thin in the day, thick in the night. It disappears when it sleeps. What is it?

00:16:59.740 --> 00:17:01.240
A riddle?

00:17:01.240 --> 00:17:02.700
I'm not good at these.

00:17:02.700 --> 00:17:04.660
Just try to answer it.

00:17:04.660 --> 00:17:07.170
I'm not sure.

00:17:07.170 --> 00:17:08.240
Is it a shadow?

00:17:09.340 --> 00:17:11.840
But a shadow becomes thin at dusk.

00:17:12.130 --> 00:17:13.130
You're wrong!

00:17:14.170 --> 00:17:18.200
You can't get through here if you don't figure out the answer.

00:17:18.200 --> 00:17:19.090
I know!

00:17:19.090 --> 00:17:19.510
What?

00:17:19.510 --> 00:17:20.970
Cat's eyes!

00:17:20.970 --> 00:17:23.600
Ehhhh!! You're right!

00:17:23.600 --> 00:17:25.110
Oh yeah!

00:17:25.110 --> 00:17:27.460
They're thin durin' the day, and thick at night.

00:17:28.440 --> 00:17:29.520
Now, let us through.

00:17:29.520 --> 00:17:34.030
I have no choice. Ah, this is boring, not fun at all.

00:17:35.860 --> 00:17:37.790
Great job, Doremi-chan!

00:17:37.790 --> 00:17:40.510
Your math may be bad, but you're good at this sort of thing.

00:17:40.510 --> 00:17:41.450
I guess!

00:17:43.170 --> 00:17:45.250
So, what next?

00:17:45.250 --> 00:17:49.440
I don't know where the tower is from here.

00:17:49.440 --> 00:17:51.500
This is bad. What do we do now?

00:17:51.950 --> 00:17:52.460
What? That's...

00:17:52.460 --> 00:17:53.880
Witch's Meadow Shortcut
What? That's...

00:17:53.880 --> 00:17:55.810
We can go through that.

00:17:55.810 --> 00:17:57.150
But how?

00:17:57.150 --> 00:17:59.150
Time to use magic.

00:17:59.150 --> 00:17:59.890
Yep!

00:18:01.180 --> 00:18:04.770
Pirika Pirilala Poporina Peperuto!

00:18:05.630 --> 00:18:10.230
Paipai Ponpoi Puwapuwa Puu!

00:18:10.790 --> 00:18:15.570
Pameruku Laruku Larilori Poppun!

00:18:15.570 --> 00:18:18.070
Become small!

00:18:20.570 --> 00:18:21.950
Witch's Meadow Shortcut

00:18:21.950 --> 00:18:22.810
Let's go!

00:18:29.710 --> 00:18:30.740
What's that sound?

00:18:30.740 --> 00:18:32.080
It's comin' from behind us.

00:18:32.080 --> 00:18:33.170
I have a bad feeling about this.

00:18:44.060 --> 00:18:45.860
We're safe...

00:18:46.980 --> 00:18:49.040
I thought we were goners.

00:18:49.040 --> 00:18:51.270
What a rush...

00:18:51.270 --> 00:18:53.020
This is it.

00:18:54.940 --> 00:18:58.560
The ride was awful, but at least it turned out to be a shortcut!

00:19:01.370 --> 00:19:03.290
There's one over here.

00:19:05.080 --> 00:19:06.690
Ah, that's it!

00:19:06.690 --> 00:19:08.120
That was easy!

00:19:11.320 --> 00:19:12.070
It's running away.

00:19:12.070 --> 00:19:13.170
That thing...

00:19:13.170 --> 00:19:14.170
A running grass.

00:19:15.920 --> 00:19:19.140
Oh I'm mad now! I'll get you no matter what!

00:19:19.140 --> 00:19:20.400
Chase after it!

00:19:20.400 --> 00:19:21.130
Yeah.

00:19:21.130 --> 00:19:23.780
It's alright. I'll think of something by myself.

00:19:23.780 --> 00:19:24.630
Leave it to me.

00:19:25.500 --> 00:19:26.350
Alright.

00:19:26.350 --> 00:19:27.100
Good luck!

00:19:27.100 --> 00:19:28.510
Wait right there!

00:19:28.510 --> 00:19:30.810
You're my ticket to passing the level 9 exam!

00:19:36.690 --> 00:19:38.870
This won't do. Gotta think of something.

00:19:42.190 --> 00:19:43.820
I'll get you with this! Here I go!

00:19:47.560 --> 00:19:48.890
I finally got you!

00:19:48.890 --> 00:19:49.910
Doremi-chan!

00:19:50.750 --> 00:19:52.420
You did it!

00:19:53.420 --> 00:19:54.880
Huh? That's...

00:19:55.850 --> 00:19:57.090
Mota's house!

00:19:57.090 --> 00:20:02.010
We traveled so far just to get back here?

00:20:02.010 --> 00:20:04.380
Oh! This is it!

00:20:04.380 --> 00:20:06.260
You're late! Where in the world have you been?

00:20:06.260 --> 00:20:08.540
I got lost...

00:20:08.540 --> 00:20:10.810
Eh!? You got lost?

00:20:10.810 --> 00:20:12.830
How could you have gotten lost?

00:20:12.830 --> 00:20:16.310
The Witch's Meadow is right behind this house.

00:20:16.310 --> 00:20:16.940
Eeeehhh!?

00:20:17.690 --> 00:20:18.940
It is...

00:20:20.740 --> 00:20:22.240
What are you doing?

00:20:22.240 --> 00:20:25.240
I'm making the medicine.....

00:20:33.910 --> 00:20:36.750
Well? Are you cured? Will you pass her if you are?

00:20:37.290 --> 00:20:40.180
Well... Since my cold is cured...

00:20:41.010 --> 00:20:42.220
You pass...

00:20:42.220 --> 00:20:43.680
Here you go...

00:20:53.200 --> 00:20:54.060
I did it!

00:20:54.060 --> 00:20:56.020
We did it! We did it!

00:20:57.960 --> 00:20:59.730
What's with you!?

00:21:00.630 --> 00:21:01.650
Uh-oh!

00:21:01.650 --> 00:21:03.490
That's great! That's great!

00:21:03.490 --> 00:21:06.800
Doremi-chan is a level 9 witch apprentice now.

00:21:06.800 --> 00:21:08.180
You two are out of line!

00:21:08.180 --> 00:21:09.950
You shouldn't come along no matter how worried you are!

00:21:09.950 --> 00:21:11.950
And you too Doremi!

00:21:11.950 --> 00:21:13.960
Can't you take the make-up exam without your friends?

00:21:15.370 --> 00:21:16.370
We're sorry.

00:21:16.370 --> 00:21:17.790
Can'tcha make an exception?

00:21:17.790 --> 00:21:20.220
But Majo Rika, isn't this great?

00:21:20.220 --> 00:21:23.560
Doremi has finally passed the level 9 exam somehow.

00:21:23.560 --> 00:21:28.260
Surely my mind is at ease for now. But it's still a matter of life and death for me.

00:21:30.470 --> 00:21:32.270
So clumsy...

00:21:33.730 --> 00:21:36.070
She looks just like Doremi-chan.

00:21:36.070 --> 00:21:38.370
What? What do you mean by that?

00:21:38.370 --> 00:21:40.360
Nothin', just a feeling.

00:21:40.360 --> 00:21:42.570
I think you're quite a match.

00:21:43.400 --> 00:21:45.200
That clumsy fairy is my match?

00:21:45.200 --> 00:21:50.450
An Ojamajo like you should be thankful to have a fairy.

00:21:52.700 --> 00:21:56.410
Would you stop calling me an Ojamajo!?

00:22:02.030 --> 00:22:03.250
What am I going to do?

00:22:03.250 --> 00:22:05.670
Dodo ran away from home.

00:22:05.670 --> 00:22:07.430
Where is she going?

00:22:07.430 --> 00:22:09.980
Is Doremi-chan being too mean to her?

00:22:09.980 --> 00:22:12.350
It'll be terrible if we don't find her fast.

00:22:12.350 --> 00:22:13.850
No worries!

00:22:13.850 --> 00:22:18.100
Don't we have the great magic of Magical Stage?

00:22:18.100 --> 00:22:19.670
We'll find Dodo fer sure.

00:22:21.480 --> 00:22:22.600
Ojamajo Doremi!

00:22:22.600 --> 00:22:24.870
Where Did You Go!? Dodo the Fairy.
